@startuml
title SwapCampus 核心实体子图：校园服务

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 80

hide methods
top to bottom direction

package "供需信息" {
  class "用户" as User {
    +用户ID
    +昵称
    +信用分
  }

  class "服务发布" as CampusServiceListing {
    +发布ID
    +意向
    +标题
    +金额
    +状态
  }

  class "服务图片" as CampusServiceImage {
    +图片ID
    +图片地址
  }
}

package "履约过程" {
  class "服务订单" as CampusServiceOrder {
    +订单ID
    +状态
    +申请说明
    +成交金额
  }
}

User -[hidden]down- CampusServiceListing
CampusServiceListing -[hidden]down- CampusServiceOrder
CampusServiceListing -[hidden]right- CampusServiceImage

User "1" -down- "0..*" CampusServiceListing : 发布 / 提供
CampusServiceListing "1" -down- "0..*" CampusServiceOrder : 转化为
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" CampusServiceOrder : 委托方 / 服务方
CampusServiceListing "1" -right- "0..*" CampusServiceImage : 包含

note right of CampusServiceListing
服务发布属于信息层。
同时支持双向供需。
end note

note right of CampusServiceOrder
服务订单属于履约层。
记录匹配与完成过程。
收藏、行为记录在本图省略。
end note

@enduml
